            "subtitle_tag": "h1",
            "subtitle": "",
            "text": "<p>Easy to set up with complete step-by-step instructions provided. Simply mark out the robot mower's cutting area with the boundary wire and pegs that are supplied. Simple keypad operation. No complicated apps needed.</p>",
